        "TileImage": "$($repository c69d9281-28cd-4aeb-a4f4-ab1e8b25c823).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47.\r\rFollowing the death of Rico Delgado, the major drug trafficing routes have shifted rather, drasticly. And unfortunatly for our client, the new center, is none other then sapienza.\rThe client has requested for three individuals to be &apos;&apos;banished&apos;&apos; out of sapienza, for ever.\r\rYour targets are as following.\rTorres Piombo, a former smuggler for Delgado.\rDaniel Samper, crooked bodyguard of the town local lawyer\rEmilio Milani, a employee of the local sanguine store.\r\rGoodluck, 47.",
